  "description": "EMAIL ENQUIRIES ONLY - Please note that due to the high level of enquiries, we cannot always respond to your correspondence. \n\nStewart Estate Agents are proud to present this spacious and bright 3 bedroom apartment to the market in excellent condition. \n\nThis apartment is a gem close to the busy Sandyford village. Situated on the first floor of a well maintained complex. The sunshine reaches most of the rooms throughout the day, while mature trees provide privacy and the feeling of living in a green suburb. \n\nIt is conveniently located with easy access to public transportation, shops, cafes and restaurants of Sandyford and Dundrum town. There is a parking place allocated to the apartment and the M50 and Luas is just a stone throw away.\n \nBriefly comprising: \n\nEntrance Hall: Spacious and homely with semi solid wooden flooring, which continues throughout the apartment. \nMain Bathroom: fully tiled with bathtub and shower attachment.\nKitchen/dining room: generous size and bright, well equipped with integrated appliances such as dishwasher, gas hob, electric oven and washing machine-dryer.\nLiving room: another sunny and sizeable room with high ceiling and a balcony which wraps around the building leading to the kitchen.\nThe three double bedrooms offer plenty of space and comfort with built-in wardrobes and an en-suite of the main bedroom. The back bedroom also has a lovely balcony with spectacular views of Dublin city.\nA hot press and a small storage room gives extra space to hide unsightly bits and bobs around the home.\n\nGas central heating, double glazed windows and telecom system makes this place cozy and comfortable.\nThis is a home to be!\n\nPlease note references will be required prior to letting.\n \nEMAIL ENQUIRIES ONLY - Please note that due to the high level of enquiries, we cannot always respond to your correspondence.",
